Equate distances \\(PA^2 = PB^2\\)\n\n\\[\n(x-1)^2 + (0+1)^2 + (z-0)^2 = (x-2)^2 + (0-1)^2 + (z-2)^2\n\\]\n\nSimplify:\n\nLeft: \\((x-1)^2 + 1 + z^2\\)  \nRight: \\((x-2)^2 + 1 + (z-2)^2\\)\n\nCancel the \\(1\\)'s:\n\n\\[\n(x-1)^2 + z^2 = (x-2)^2 + (z-2)^2\n\\]\n\nExpand:\n\n\\[\nx^2 - 2x + 1 + z^2 = x^2 - 4x + 4 + z^2 - 4z + 4\n\\]\n\nCancel \\(x^2\\) and \\(z^2\\):\n\n\\[\n-2x + 1 = -4x + 8 - 4z\n\\]\n\n\\[\n2x + 4z = 7\n\\]\n\\[\nx + 2z = \\frac{7}{2} \\quad (1)\n\\]\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Equate distances \\(PA^2 = PC^2\\)\n\n\\[\n(x-1)^2 + 1 + z^2 = (x-3)^2 + (0-2)^2 + (z+1)^2\n\\]\n\nRight side: \\((x-3)^2 + 4 + (z+1)^2\\)\n\nExpand left: \\(x^2 - 2x + 1 + 1 + z^2 = x^2 - 2x + 2 + z^2\\)\n\nRight: \\(x^2 - 6x + 9 + 4 + z^2 + 2z + 1\\)  \n= \\(x^2 - 6x + 14 + z^2 + 2z\\)\n\nCancel \\(x^2\\) and \\(z^2\\):\n\n\\[\n-2x + 2 = -6x + 14 + 2z\n\\]\n\n\\[\n4x - 2z = 12\n\\]\n\\[\n2x - z = 6 \\quad (2)\n\\]\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Solve system\n\nFrom (1): \\(x + 2z = \\frac{7}{2}\\)  \nFrom (2): \\(2x - z = 6\\)\n\nFrom (2): \\(z = 2x - 6\\)\n\nSubstitute into (1):\n\n\\[\nx + 2(2x - 6) = \\frac{7}{2}\n\\]\n\\[\nx + 4x - 12 = \\frac{7}{2}\n\\]\n\\[\n5x = \\frac{7}{2} + 12 = \\frac{7}{2} + \\frac{24}{2} = \\frac{31}{2}\n\\]\n\\[\nx = \\frac{31}{10}\n\\]\n\nThen \\(z = 2\\cdot \\frac{31}{10} - 6 = \\frac{62}{10} - \\frac{60}{10} = \\frac{2}{10} = \\frac{1}{5}\\)\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Final point\n\n\\[\n\\left( \\frac{31}{10}, 0, \\frac{1}{5} \\right)\n\\]\n\nThe answer is \\(\\left(\\frac{31}{10}, 0, \\frac{1}{5}\\right)\\).","usage":{"completion_tokens":790,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":0,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":98,"prompt_tokens":98,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"total_tokens":888}},{"finish_reason":"stop","gold_exposed":false,"model":"deepseek-flash","origin":"DEEPSEEK","reasoning_tokens":0,"request_sha256":"9a34ed14536d1a1853b7ddbf04a17eacadeca43f3281da6c904ac40150899751","text":"Let's verify the equations carefully.\n\nPoint in \\(xz\\)-plane: \\(P=(x,0,